#. ~ Description of "heraldic cape"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid ""
"Sable and argent fields retreat diagonally from a full-moon sigil.  Its "
"metallic fibers reveal holographic motifs in accordance with ambient light."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Item name
