#. ~ Description of variant "jungle-camo tactical jacket" of item "tactical
#. jacket"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid ""
"Bright and dark green shades meet within the patterning of this tactical "
"jacket, embellished by tones of earthen brown and other natural hues.  The "
"trees of the Amazon will speak your native tongue as you stalk around, waging"
" guerrilla warfare against the undead, with this jacket on.  It's just a "
"shame that the rainforest is quite a walk away."
msgstr ""

